#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online Help"
msgstr "Pomoć na vezi"

#. Tag: date
#: index.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "2010-05-13"
msgstr "2010-05-13"

#. Tag: releaseinfo
#: index.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; 4.5"
msgstr "&kde; 4.5"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On this page, you can find different ways to find online help and additional "
"information provided by the KDE community."
msgstr ""
"Na ovoj stranici, možete pronaći različite načine za pomoć na vezi i dodatne "
"informacije koje obezbjeđuje KDE zajednica."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDE UserBase"
msgstr "KDE Korisnička baza"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/An_introduction_to_KDE\">An "
"Introduction to KDE</ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/An_introduction_to_KDE\">Uvod u KDE</"
"ulink>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Learn more about the <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/What_is_KDE\"> KDE "
"community and its software</ulink> and find information to help you get "
"started. Also, discover what <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/"
"Welcome_to_KDE_UserBase\"> UserBase</ulink> is and how it can help you."
msgstr ""
"Nauči više o <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/What_is_KDE\"> KDE "
"zajednici i o njihovom softveru </ulink>i naži informacije koje će Vam "
"pomoći da počnete. Također, otkrijte sta je <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde."
"org/Welcome_to_KDE_UserBase\"> UserBase</ulink> i kako Vam može pomoći."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/Getting_Help\">Getting Help</"
"ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/Getting_Help\">Dobijanje pomoći</"
"ulink>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Need some help? Here are some suggested places where you can get help with "
"problems, as well some hints on how to improve the quality of answers you "
"receive."
msgstr ""
"Trebate pomoć? Evo par prijedloga nekih mjesta gdje možete dobiti pomoć za "
"Vaše probleme, kao i neke savjete o tome kako poboljšati kvalitetu odgovora "
"koje ste primili."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/Applications\">Applications</"
"ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/Applications\">Aplikacije</ulink>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Discover the wide variety of applications from the KDE Community, and find "
"out what program suits your needs and preferences."
msgstr ""
"Otkrijte široku paletu aplikacija iz KDE zajednice, i saznajte koji program "
"odgovara vašim potrebama i željama."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/Tutorials\">Tutorials</ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/Tutorials\">Tutorjali</ulink>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How-To's, Tips &amp; Tricks that can help make your KDE software experience "
"more enjoyable and productive."
msgstr ""
"How-To's, Tips &amp; Trikovi koji mogu pomoći kako bi vaš KDE softver "
"učinili još ugodnijim i produktivnijim."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDE Forum"
msgstr "KDE Forum"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "<ulink url=\"http://forum.kde.org/\">KDE Community Forums</ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://forum.kde.org/\">Forumi KDE zajednica</ulink>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KDE Forums offer users, developers and people interested in KDE a place "
"to help each other, discuss KDE-related topics and exchange ideas. You can "
"find <ulink url=\"http://forum.kde.org/viewforum.php?f=14/\">Tutorials &amp; "
"Tips</ulink> in the forum."
msgstr ""
"KDE forum nudi korisnicima, programerima i ljucima zainteresovanim u KDE "
"mjesto gdje mogu pomoći jedni drugima, razgovarati o KDE temama, i "
"razmjenjivati ideje. Možete naći <ulink url=\"http://forum.kde.org/viewforum."
"php?f=14/\">Tutorials &amp; Tips</ulink> u forumima."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDE Techbase"
msgstr "KDE Tehnobaza"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "<ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/\">KDE Techbase</ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr "<ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/\">KDE Tehnobaza</ulink>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Information for developers and help to set up a KDE development environment."
msgstr ""
"Informacija za programere i pomoć da se postavi KDE razvojno okruženje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDE Documentation"
msgstr "KDE dokumentacija"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://docs.kde.org/\">KDE Documentation site</ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://docs.kde.org/\">stranica KDE dokumentacije</ulink>&nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This page holds the complete KDE User Documentation in over 25 languages for "
"the released and the development version of KDE SC."
msgstr ""
"Ova stranica sadrži kompletnu KDE korisničku dokumentaciju u preko 25 jezika "
"za izdatu i razvojnu vertiju KDE SC-a."
